Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: retro CRT-style terminal emulator
 Lunduke Terminal is a GTK 3 terminal emulator with the look of an old CRT
 monitor: phosphor glow, scanlines, burn-in, curvature, RGB shift and an
 optional monitor bezel. The effects run on OpenGL 3.3 with a C++ fallback.
 The default profile is a plain terminal without effects.
